se with esophageal cancer (ELA patients). Body composition analysis in these patients helps determine the levels of fat, lean mass, and hydration, which are essential for tailoring effective nutritional strategies. Additionally, it is important to note that body composition can change significantly in patients undergoing treatment for esophageal cancer, highlighting the need for ongoing assessment and adjustment of nutritional plans.", "HIGIÉNICO-DIETÉTICAS:Las medidas higiénico-dietéticas son prácticas recomendadas para optimizar la ingesta nutricional en pacientes con esclerosis lateral amiotrófica.", "SUPORTE NUTRICIONAL:SUPORTE NUTRICIONAL se refiere a un conjunto de intervenciones diseñadas para mejorar el estado nutricional de los pacientes, especialmente aquellos que están en riesgo de desnutrición. Estas intervenciones son fundamentales para asegurar que los pacientes reciban la nutrición adecuada necesaria para su recuperación y bienestar.", "COBALAMINA (B12):La cobalamina, o vitamina B12, es esencial para la mielinización, un proceso crítico para la función neuronal.", "PIRIDOXINA (B6):La piridoxina, o vitamina B6, es importante para la síntesis de reguladores bioquímicos que afectan la función cerebral.", "ÁCIDO FÓLICO (B9):El ácido fólico, o vitamina B9, es crucial para el desarrollo fetal del sistema nervioso central.", "FRAMINGHAM STUDY:The Framingham Study is a long-term, ongoing cardiovascular cohort study of residents of the town of Framingham, Massachusetts, which has provided significant insights into the relationship between omega-3 levels and cognitive function.", "OMEGA-3:Omega-3 refers to a group of polyunsaturated fatty acids that are important for human health, particularly in relation to cognitive function and inflammation.", "EATING BEHAVIOR SCALE:The Eating Behavior Scale is a tool used to assess the ability of individuals, particularly those with cognitive impairments, to eat independently.", "L-DOPA:L-DOPA es un medicamento utilizado en el tratamiento de la enfermedad de Parkinson que requiere una absorción adecuada para ser efectivo.", "GRUPO NADYA-SENPE:The GRUPO NADYA-SENPE is a Spanish organization dedicated to home enteral nutrition. It functions as a working group that focuses on artificial nutrition in the home setting, engaging in various reports and studies related to enteral nutrition. Through its efforts, GRUPO NADYA-SENPE aims to enhance the understanding and implementation of enteral nutrition practices in Spain.", "ENFERMEDAD DE MOTONEURONA:", "FOOD TRIAL COLLABORATION:The FOOD Trial Collaboration is a group that conducts research on nutritional status and its impact on stroke outcomes."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}